# What a deployment holds. These are the right shape and answer nowhere: `docs/setups/clerk.md`
# and `docs/setups/hetzner-cloud.md` say where each real one comes from, and `bunx convex env set`
# is what puts it there. A value's shape is what this file is for, so none of them is blank.
